## Original Content
La institución asegura que solo recibió información sobre el aumento progresivo de las llegadas por mar y sostiene que ningún informe permitía anticipar la magnitud de lo ocurrido el 30 de julio.

## Summary
The Government Delegation in Ceuta denies having received prior warnings about the massive entry of migrants on July 30, supporting Marlaska's version. They assert that only information about a gradual increase in sea arrivals was available, and no reports could have predicted the event's scale.

## Key Points
- Delegation denies receiving warnings about the massive migrant entry
- Only gradual increase in sea arrivals was reported
- No reports anticipated the magnitude of the July 30 event
- Delegation supports Marlaska's account of the incident


